          "counted": null,
          "countedNote": null,
          "key": "Bacon, Smithfield"
        }
      ],
      "body": "Layer bacon and pork in the loaf pan, bacon first, until all the meat is in. It can mound over the top. Cover tightly. Refrigerate <span class=\"rc-nw\">4–36 h</span>."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Roast uncovered at <span class=\"rc-nw\">275 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(135 °C)</span></span> on a foil-lined sheet pan until completely tender, ≈4 h. Cool slightly, cover and refrigerate ≥2 h or overnight."
    },
