      "body": "Oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">350 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(177 °C)</span></span>. Lift out the loaf and scrape off its fat and jelly. Keep fat and juices separate. Brush the pineapple with melted fat and roast on foil until tender, ≈25 min."
