  "nutritionSource": "USDA FoodData Central: SR Legacy (chiles, canola, cumin, oregano, vinegar, sugar, garlic, pork loin roast, bacon, pineapple, onion, cilantro) and Branded Foods labels (Better Than Bouillon, La Nuestra achiote, La Costeña, Morton, El Milagro). Pork and bacon counted raw, including all the fat; much of the bacon fat drips off, so real calories are lower. Water, salsa and limes not counted.",
