  "notes": [
    "Center-cut loin is leaner than the blade-end loin Kenji uses, so the bacon carries the fat. Don’t skip it.",
    "Serious Eats measures Diamond Crystal: 2½ tsp Diamond weighs the same as 1½ tsp Morton.",
    "The cooked loaf keeps a few days in the fridge, so only the day-2 steps are day-of work.",
    "Grill instead: cool side of the grill at ≈<span class=\"rc-nw\">275 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(135 °C)</span></span> air until <span class=\"rc-nw\">180–190 °F</span> in the center, ≈4 h."
